OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors encouraged to 'discover
OL,4,Asomewhere new'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new initiative aims to help tourism
OL,7,Fbusinesses across Yorkshire attract
OL,8,Fmore visitors to "discover somewhere
OL,9,Fnew" by turning short breaks into
OL,10,Flonger stays.
OL,12,FA government grant will be used to try
OL,13,Fto encourage tourists from Europe to
OL,14,Fvisit parts of the area away from the
OL,15,Fmore traditional attractions, said
OL,16,FVisit Hull and East Yorkshire (VHEY),
OL,17,Fwhich is leading the campaign.
OL,19,FMoney will be used to help smaller
OL,20,Ftourism businesses "prepare their
OL,21,Fexperiences for sale through tour
OL,22,Foperators".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
